    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/a8df3996cfb1a73f2b3f4c040cbef80a.poster.avif?t=1748556098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/a8df3996cfb1a73f2b3f4c040cbef80a.webm?t=1748556098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/a8df3996cfb1a73f2b3f4c040cbef80a.mp4?t=1748556098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary classic game &quot;PONG&quot; returns with stunning visuals and emotionally stirring sound!<br>A high-performance AI precisely predicts the ball's trajectory and counters with calculated moves.<br>If you can clear STAGE 30, you're a true super player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/bd7cd51f690f6a3dadb161dcbec579dc.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE is conquered by winning 3 rounds first: win to move to the next STAGE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI: adapts to the player\u2019s movements for a strategic battle of offense and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite continues: retry anytime, fight until you're satisfied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless STAGE: the challenge never ends, difficulty keeps rising!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE 1\u20133: great for basic training, beginner-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE 10+: a super high difficulty mode that tests the AI\u2019s full potential</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/6d4d9f9c4a5b8e761d8466e661740604.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals &amp; Sound Evolution:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber-themed stunning graphics draw players into an extraordinary world.<br>Fantastical, otherworldly music heightens the dramatic gaming experience.<br>Once you play, it\u2019s addictive\u2014you\u2019ll want to come back again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/9532da8bbf0338f361c574123e449ef8.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Motivation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first time I played \u201cPONG\u201d was at an arcade.<br>Oddly, it drew me in more than the newest games, and before I knew it, I was hooked.<br>When I tried creating it myself, I was amazed by the strategic depth hidden in its simplicity.<br>Especially with AI paddle behavior, there\u2019s so much room for innovation\u2014the push-and-pull between attack and defense makes the game incredibly deep.<br>Its simplicity fuels the thrill\u2014this is a game packed with tactical excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/fba01ff9a94ac771ab28b1a0cb21fa8a.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/a8df3996cfb1a73f2b3f4c040cbef80a.poster.avif?t=1748556098\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/a8df3996cfb1a73f2b3f4c040cbef80a.webm?t=1748556098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/a8df3996cfb1a73f2b3f4c040cbef80a.mp4?t=1748556098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary classic game &quot;PONG&quot; returns with stunning visuals and emotionally stirring sound!<br>A high-performance AI precisely predicts the ball's trajectory and counters with calculated moves.<br>If you can clear STAGE 30, you're a true super player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/bd7cd51f690f6a3dadb161dcbec579dc.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE is conquered by winning 3 rounds first: win to move to the next STAGE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI: adapts to the player\u2019s movements for a strategic battle of offense and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite continues: retry anytime, fight until you're satisfied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless STAGE: the challenge never ends, difficulty keeps rising!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE 1\u20133: great for basic training, beginner-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE 10+: a super high difficulty mode that tests the AI\u2019s full potential</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/6d4d9f9c4a5b8e761d8466e661740604.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals &amp; Sound Evolution:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber-themed stunning graphics draw players into an extraordinary world.<br>Fantastical, otherworldly music heightens the dramatic gaming experience.<br>Once you play, it\u2019s addictive\u2014you\u2019ll want to come back again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/9532da8bbf0338f361c574123e449ef8.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Motivation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first time I played \u201cPONG\u201d was at an arcade.<br>Oddly, it drew me in more than the newest games, and before I knew it, I was hooked.<br>When I tried creating it myself, I was amazed by the strategic depth hidden in its simplicity.<br>Especially with AI paddle behavior, there\u2019s so much room for innovation\u2014the push-and-pull between attack and defense makes the game incredibly deep.<br>Its simplicity fuels the thrill\u2014this is a game packed with tactical excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752720/extras/fba01ff9a94ac771ab28b1a0cb21fa8a.avif?t=1748556098\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
